{"id": "caltrain-station-apartment-embezzlement", "title": "Two Caltrain stations were remodeled for personal use with public funds", "seconds": 59.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "2fa7d7cb67cdc6ac", "words": 145, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In March 2024, Caltrain said an anonymous tip led it to investigate work at two stations.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.23, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "used", "the", "stations?"], "sub": "Caltrain"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.56, 0.89, 1.58, 2.13, 2.37, 2.49, 3.07, 3.45, 3.7, 3.79, 3.91, 4.54, 4.83, 4.97, 5.22]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The District Attorney said the work at Burlingame was for Joseph Navarro, a former Caltrain deputy director.", "t0": 6.35, "t1": 12.55, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "interview", "kicker": "SFGATE, Ida Mojadad", "text": "Burlingame and Millbrae", "mark": "Burlingame and Millbrae"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.56, 1.02, 1.23, 1.32, 1.59, 1.7, 2.32, 2.52, 2.71, 3.18, 3.94, 4.11, 4.52, 5.13, 5.56]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The work at Millbrae was for Seth Worden, a station manager employed by the operating contractor.", "t0": 12.67, "t1": 18.3, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Millbrae station"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.51, 1.06, 1.25, 1.44, 1.8, 2.44, 2.6, 3.05, 3.49, 3.93, 4.09, 4.23, 4.77]}, {"scene": "court", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Worden pleaded no contest to misdemeanor embezzlement and testified at Navarro’s trial.", "t0": 18.52, "t1": 23.98, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "worden", "kicker": "Palo Alto Daily Post, Adriana Hernandez reporting District Attorney Stephen Wagstaffe’s account", "text": "Misdemeanor plea", "mark": "Misdemeanor plea"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.88, 1.11, 1.74, 1.85, 2.53, 3.29, 3.51, 4.21, 4.34, 4.92]}, {"scene": "court", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A jury convicted Navarro of one felony count of misusing public funds.", "t0": 24.1, "t1": 28.75, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "verdict", "kicker": "CBS News Bay Area, reporting the San Mateo County District Attorney’s account", "text": "April 30 verdict", "mark": "April 30 verdict"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.57, 1.05, 1.63, 1.82, 2.07, 2.56, 2.9, 3.04, 3.67, 4.08]}, {"scene": "court", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Worden received 60 days in jail. Navarro received 120 days.", "t0": 28.87, "t1": 34.22, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "June 2025 sentences", "heading": "County jail terms", "source": "interview", "rows": [{"icon": "decision", "label": "Worden", "value": "60 days"}, {"icon": "decision", "label": "Navarro", "value": "120 days"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.91, 1.38, 1.69, 1.83, 2.76, 3.35, 3.78, 4.0, 4.39, 4.84]}, {"scene": "court", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The prosecutor said Navarro received credit for 28 days already served.", "t0": 34.34, "t1": 38.88, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Credit for time served"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.76, 0.99, 1.5, 1.93, 2.31, 2.47, 3.07, 3.5, 4.01]}, {"scene": "amount", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Two news accounts put Worden’s restitution order at about 8,000 dollars.", "t0": 39.1, "t1": 43.65, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "court", "kicker": "The Mercury News, distributed by Tribune Content Agency via Transit Talent", "text": "Restitution hearing coverage", "mark": "Restitution hearing coverage"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.54, 1.06, 1.33, 1.8, 2.49, 2.76, 2.85, 3.14, 3.41, 3.87]}, {"scene": "amount", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Their precise figures differ by thirty dollars.", "t0": 43.77, "t1": 46.43, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Two published figures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.7, 1.17, 1.51, 1.69, 2.04]}, {"scene": "amount", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The defense disputed the restitution prosecutors sought from Navarro.", "t0": 46.55, "t1": 50.44, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "court", "kicker": "The Mercury News, distributed by Tribune Content Agency via Transit Talent", "text": "Disputed restitution", "mark": "Disputed restitution"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 1.16, 1.28, 1.99, 2.67, 2.99, 3.2]}, {"scene": "amount", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Navarro’s final award and actual collections from either person remain unverified.", "t0": 50.56, "t1": 55.67, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Signed orders", "Payment receipts"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 1.05, 1.56, 1.75, 2.13, 2.71, 2.96, 3.3, 3.77, 4.19]}, {"scene": "amount", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 55.79, "t1": 58.4, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Two stations", "court": "Separate court outcomes", "amount": "What was ordered?"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "timeline"}